Subject: [PATCH] linux-atm: retain removed ATM userspace ABI declarations

Linux 7.3 removed legacy ATM headers and SVC ioctl declarations. Keep
exported Linux 5.4.302 UAPI headers in a private compatibility directory,
enabled only for Linux 7.3 and later. Kernel-only CONFIG_COMPAT declarations
are omitted. This does not restore removed kernel ATM facilities.

Signed-off-by: coolsnowwolf <coolsnowwolf@gmail.com>

